---
---

<section id="requisitos" style="padding: var(--space-xl) 0;">
  <div class="section-container">

    <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <span class="pill-label">REQUISITOS · REQUIREMENTS</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
        O que precisamos de ti.
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.05rem;">
        Para começar, precisamos de pouco. O resto, nós tratamos.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="req-grid">

      <!-- Column 1: OBRIGATÓRIO -->
      <div class="glass" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" style="margin-bottom:1rem; opacity:0.8;">
          <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
          <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
        </svg>
        <div style="display:inline-block; padding:0.2rem 0.6rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:999px; font-size:0.7rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom:1rem;">Da tua responsabilidade</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:1rem;">Material do cliente</h3>
        <ul style="list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.55rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">✓</span>
            Logo em vetor, PDF, EPS ou PNG
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">✓</span>
            Fotos do negócio ou serviços (se houver)
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">✓</span>
            Texto sobre o negócio e serviços/produtos
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">✓</span>
            Contactos: telefone, email, WhatsApp
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="color:#4ade80; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem;">✓</span>
            Redes sociais a incluir no site
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.65; font-size:0.85rem;">
          Todo o conteúdo textual e visual a incluir no site é da responsabilidade do cliente.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: OPCIONAL -->
      <div class="glass" style="padding: 2rem;">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" style="margin-bottom:1rem; opacity:0.8;">
          <path d="M12 2l2 7h7l-5.5 4 2 7L12 16l-5.5 4 2-7L3 9h7z"/>
        </svg>
        <div style="display:inline-block; padding:0.2rem 0.6rem; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius:999px; font-size:0.7rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom:1rem;">Kairos trata — opcional</div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:1rem;">Não tens tudo? Sem problema.</h3>
        <ul style="list-style:none; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.55rem; margin-bottom:1.25rem;">
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem; opacity:0.5;">○</span>
            Copy e textos das páginas
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem; opacity:0.5;">○</span>
            Paleta de cores e direção visual
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem; opacity:0.5;">○</span>
            Logo Pack: logo, paleta e tipografia (opcional pago, ver Planos)
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; align-items:flex-start; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.9rem;">
            <span style="flex-shrink:0; margin-top:0.05rem; opacity:0.5;">○</span>
            Sessão de fotografia profissional (opcional pago, ver Planos)
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p style="color:var(--text-muted); line-height:1.65; font-size:0.85rem;">
          Se não souberes se tens domínio ou alojamento, incluímos uma call de orientação de 30 minutos após contratação.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.9rem; font-style:italic;">
      Sem logo? Sem fotos? Não bloqueias. Arrancamos com o que tens e definimos o resto juntos.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .req-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .req-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
